        "en": "Morning starts in Split's center exploring the Roman heritage. Midday takes you up to the majestic Klis Fortress for a mountain panorama. Afternoon is dedicated to Trogir, a small island city of stone. Evening ends back in Split with a sea view.",
        "hr": "Jutro počinje u centru Splita istraživanjem rimske baštine. Sredina dana vodi vas do veličanstvene tvrđave Klis za planinsku panoramu. Poslijepodne je posvećeno Trogiru, kamenom gradu na otoku. Večer završava povratkom u Split s pogledom na more."
